# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of the checkout
# platform's own core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows runners
# (core.autocrlf=true by default) check out these already-LF-committed
# files as CRLF, which fails Biome's format check (biome ci .) — every
# text file in this repo, verified directly against a failing Windows CI
# run on 2026-09-10.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
